          "title": "You'll want to know: धूल",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "धूल — dhūl — \"dust\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "आँधी के बाद हर चीज़ पर धूल थी। ā̃dhī ke bād har cīz par dhūl thī. After the dust storm everything was covered in dust."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "धूल (dhūl) comes from Sanskrit dhūli, \"dust, powder\", which CDIAL files under dhūḍi (CDIAL 6835) with Hindi dhūl, \"dust\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for getting around."
