              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "घिरना — ghirnā — \"to be surrounded; to gather round\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "बाढ़ में हमारा गाँव पानी से घिर गया। bāṛh meṁ hamārā gā̃v pānī se ghir gayā. In the flood our village was cut off by water."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (it …): वह मैदान पेड़ों से घिरा, vah maidān peṛoṁ se ghirā."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "घिरना (ghirnā) goes back to ghir, \"go round\", a form CDIAL reconstructs and thinks may come from Dravidian (CDIAL 4474); it lists Hindi ghirnā, \"to be surrounded\"."
            }
          ]
