          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "थमना (thamnā) belongs with Sanskrit stambhate, \"supports, arrests\" (CDIAL 13683), which lists Hindi thāmnā, \"to prop, stop\"; थमना is its intransitive: the rain stops itself."
